      "id": "80df9952-c597-41a0-b65a-d68e02f7e143",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "### Helpful NullPointerException messages\r\n\r\n// Chained call\r\na.b.c.d = 42;\r\n\r\n// Java 13 and earlier:\r\n// NullPointerException  (no detail)\r\n\r\n// Java 14+:\r\n// NullPointerException: Cannot read field \"c\"\r\n//   because \"a.b\" is null\r\n\r\n// Array example\r\nint[] arr = null;\r\nint x = arr[0];\r\n// Java 14: Cannot load from int array\r\n//   because \"arr\" is null",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java"
